er my mouth. I keep the object. I keep it. I keep it. I keep it. I keep it. I keep it. I keep it. I keep it. I keep it. I keep it. I keep it. I keep it. I keep it. I keep it. I keep it. I keep it. I keep it. I keep it. I keep it. I keep it. I keep it. I keep it. I keep it. I keep it. I keep it. I keep it. I keep it. I keep it. I keep it. I keep it. I keep it. I keep it. I keep it. I keep it. I keep it", "Y": "I move the object. my hand goes over my mouth. “no.” i touch the loose piece with my thumb. “move it back.” the person leaves it there, then they move again. i keep the loose piece beside it."}]
